  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Luxury<br>\n<strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 5,000eb - 1 Month<br>\n<strong>Eligible:</strong> All Non-Explosive Power Weapons</p>\n<p>Everything the weapon fires now carries damage through destroyed Cover the way an Explosive does, and ablates 1 more SP whenever it ablates at all. On a weapon whose ammunition already behaves like an Explosive against Cover, damage to Cover, and only to Cover, doubles instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic: it can't be bought or sourced on the street, can't be fabricated without its Blueprint, can't be taken during Character Generation, and once acquired can't be destroyed unless the player agrees to it beforehand.</li>\n<li>The price is the Luxury benchmark, for working out repairs and Tech Upgrades. Iconics can't be bought.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Becoming Iconic &gt; Iconic Weapons).</em></p>"
